WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.144
Choose the coach
Open the Coach menu and select a name. Use Search coaches or search within the menu to find a coach. The meeting calendar loads after you choose the coach whose meetings you want to review.

2
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:24.228
Choose the calendar period
Use Calendar period to choose Day, Week or Month. Select Week to review meetings across the selected week.

3
00:00:24.228 --> 00:00:34.506
Filter by meeting status
Ready to action focuses on meetings ready for review. Choose All meetings to include every loaded meeting that matches the other filters.

4
00:00:34.506 --> 00:00:44.776
Choose a meeting type
Meeting type separates monthly coaching, progress reviews, student support and other meetings. Select MCM to focus on monthly coaching meetings.

5
00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:56.824
Filter by learner and LMS match
Learner narrows the results to one person. Match describes the link to an LMS booking. The time zone controls how meeting times are displayed.

6
00:00:56.824 --> 00:01:09.707
Open the meeting
Select a meeting card in the calendar to open the details drawer on the right. Use its tabs to switch between Overview, Recording, Attendance, Transcript and Quality check. Close the drawer to return to the calendar.

7
00:01:09.707 --> 00:01:18.262
Check the meeting information
In Overview, review the date, time, coach, learners and meeting type before assessing the session.

8
00:01:18.262 --> 00:01:27.978
Review recording parts
Recording lists the available saved parts. Use Play to watch a part or Download to save the file you need.

9
00:01:27.978 --> 00:01:36.623
Check actual attendance
Attendance shows participants and their time in the meeting. A scheduled appointment alone does not confirm attendance.

10
00:01:36.623 --> 00:01:45.444
Find the transcript and analysis
Open Transcript to access published transcript evidence and available analysis tools. Availability depends on the meeting type and saved evidence.

11
00:01:45.444 --> 00:01:58.381
Review teaching and coaching quality
Quality check lets you start a review for a learner and find saved checks. Close the meeting details when you are ready to return to the calendar.
